{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the pca_n2000 RNA encoder with transformer aggregation in a multiprofile, rna_only setting. Validation accuracy of 0.519 is lower than scvi_n200's multiprofile transformer setup (0.653), suggesting the RNA encoder may significantly influence performance. The role of transformer aggregation compared to other methods and its interaction with encoder choices remains uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative aggregation strategies."
}

